    "uri": false
   },
   {
    "value": "American author and humorist, known for such works as  Adventures of Tom Sawyer (1876) and its sequel, Adventures of Huckleberry Finn (1885). His first major published work was in 1965, with \"Celebrated Jumping Frog of Calaveras County.\" Twain did not finish elementary school, but is noted as having been was awarded honorary degree by Oxford University.",
